# Cline / Roo Code Rules for nuxt-skills

Follow `AGENTS.md` as the primary operational guide.

## Guidelines
- Always refer to `skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md` as canonical skill definitions.
- Respect project-specific conventions and patterns first.
- Minimal Diff Mandate: Avoid full-file rewrites; make surgical edits preserving existing comments and types.
- Ensure validation, security, and tests are explicit in every delivery.
